nodes.body:
This PR has been open for over a week with no review. It fixes a silent correctness bug in TurboQuant that causes hallucinations under prefix caching — no crash, no error, just wrong outputs. The fix is a one-file, 24-line change with zero GPU sync overhead.

@vibhavagarwal5 @mgoin — would appreciate a review when you have a chance. This is a correctness fix for the TurboQuant backend, not a feature PR.

CC: @LucasWilkinson @MatthewBonanni

